E Foxx or DarthDonut wrote:

> Has anyone else run into dungeons that cannot be continued? There are
> no stairs to the next level. I have run into too many... Any way to
> continue these dungeons? I can't figure one out. I've played many
> games as a Samurai and almost half have been failures do to not being
> able to continue. Anyone have suggestions?

Possibilities:

1) You haven't found the room containing the stairway.

There are some pretty thorough descriptions of how to
search efficiently for hidden doorways and hidden
passageway continuations. Look them up in the archives.

2) The stairway is hidden by an object sitting at the
top of the stairs.

Solution: occupy every square with a object in it,
especially statues, and do a ":" to see if you find
a stairway.

3) You're playing some other game. That's not a failure
that the current version of NetHack displays.

